this theorm is used in machine learning to predict the probability of dependent event. (dependent event is the event whos probability is affected by already happened events)

both formulas are bayes theorm
formula 1:
 
 pr(A/B)= (pr(A) * pr(B/A) )/ pr(B)

formula 2:
 pr(B/A)= (pr(B) * pr(A/B) )/ pr(A)

